{"document":{"groups":{"anonymous-planter":{"decision":"accept-neutral-referent","reason":"The complete three-line examinations compare the lilac's beauty and the bluebells' scent to their unnamed planter. Bulgarian този, който can be generic masculine and does not prove a male planter. Nevertheless it is an avoidable personal gender marker under the supplied neutrality rule. The approved world term животинка supplies grammatical agreement without naming or sexing the planter. Preserve singular tree versus plural flowers and the second line's probability.","targets":{"ds:23:20:Dialogue Text":"Също като животинката, която го е засадила.","ds:24:20:Dialogue Text":"Сигурно също като животинката, която ги е засадила."}},"beaver-vagina-slang-punchline":{"decision":"accept-explicit-word-link","literaryBoundary":"Prose source-language slang clarification; no scansion applies. No claim of equivalent spontaneous native wordplay or empirical comic effect.","reason":"169:194 craves beaver after Scarlett recalls Barnaby and Peter;195 rejects the vagina interpretation. Bulgarian бобър alone does not supply the English slang sense. Naming the quoted word in the denial makes that relation intelligible while preserving the actual animal/partner desire. It neither claims that this is established Bulgarian slang nor changes the setup or Bucky's identity. This is a complete replacement including the original picture control.","targets":{"ds:169:195:Dialogue Text":"[pic=1]… И под „бобър“ нямам предвид вагина!"}},"excuse-oneself-take-leave":{"decision":"accept","reason":"272:161 is Peter's brunch;162 moves the two women to the lake;163 begins sunset and their next flight. They take leave, not apologize. Change only that verb in the complete unit, retaining the lovely afternoon, wine and broad conversation lasting the day.","targets":{"ds:272:162:Dialogue Text":"[pic=2]После се оттеглихме и прекарахме прекрасен следобед на езерото. Пийнахме вино и говорихме за какво ли не, докато денят се изниза."}},"floaties-for-crafted-toy":{"decision":"accept","reason":"122:176-177 commissions Bucky's toy for Maverick. In124 Rascal delivers it and Maverick supplies the floaties. The repaired full unit explicitly gives these floaties to Rascal in exchange once Bucky makes the toy; it preserves the condition and direction. No inventory or reward control changes.","targets":{"ds:122:178:Dialogue Text":"[pic=4]Като го направи, ще ти дам тези ръкавели в замяна!"}},"kink-finders-ironing-pun":{"decision":"accept-recreated-double-meaning","literaryBoundary":"Prose double meaning; no meter or rhyme constraint. Interpretive linguistic assessment, not empirical audience validation. No haiku line or display/evaluation label changes.","reason":"The entire136 exchange develops a sexual consultation business, including188 hands-on service,192 payment and194 a possible bonus. Фетиши has no project-problem sense, so разплитане does not realize the announced pun. Оправяне supports fixing unfinished business and colloquial sexual servicing in that explicit setting. Keep the project incomplete, the sexual cue and the explicit deliberate-wordplay acknowledgement. The brand and other фетиш uses do not change.","targets":{"ds:136:199:Dialogue Text":"[pic=5]Звучи добре! Имаме още много за оправяне. Играта на думи е нарочна."}},"mabel-do-it-clarification":{"decision":"accept","reason":"137 asks how they could even perform the unnamed act; 138 supplies that missing predicate, and 139 answers the feasibility concern with Mabel's experience. The да echo preserves clarification rather than asking for a future decision.","targets":{"ds:71:138:Dialogue Text":"[pic=3]Какво, да го направим ли?"}},"rope-lookout-beneficiary":{"decision":"accept-with-explicit-beneficiary","ids":["ds:18:86:Dialogue Text","ds:19:86:Dialogue Text","ds:64:86:Dialogue Text"],"reason":"In all three complete introductions the requester needs comfortable, appropriately sized bondage rope. The next requests explicitly ask about that rope. The old за мен can select the requester as search object. State both the rope object and the requester beneficiary; the suggested replacement was safe but left the beneficiary implicit.","target":"[pic=1]Ще се оглеждаш ли за подходящо въже за мен?"},"rope-size-and-comfort":{"decision":"accept","reason":"Both constraints apply to the same ropes. Moving и after да са restores the conjunctive reading, with no change to size, comfort or Mabel's agency. The two exact-source prototype versions already express both constraints correctly and need no edit.","targets":{"ds:64:85:Dialogue Text":"[pic=3]Проблемът е, че не намирам въжета с моя размер, които да са и достатъчно удобни."}}},"locale":"bg","scope":"All eleven assigned independent findings, adjudicated before the consolidated application. These are editor decisions, not independent acceptance.","unchangedEvidencePolicy":"No unchanged primary judgment is invalidated solely because it neighbors a corrected line. Exact repetitions of changed wording are included among the eleven edits. Complete scenes, actual callbacks, prototypes and assembled jokes are review context. Existing case-level findings remain historical pending the exact independent delta; they are not promoted to pass by this editor."},"id":"outputs/six-next-locales-20261102-01/bg/repair-01/decisions.json","provenance":{"bytes":6117,"path":"outputs/six-next-locales-20261102-01/bg/repair-01/decisions.json","sha256":"41097c69c2c737817b81f22d97a5161346428dc97492c830fd01e8c7dfc06ab8"}}
